<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">dls</span> Research Workbench</div>
  <div class="topbar-right">
    <span id="backend-status" class="backend-status">connecting…</span>
    <button id="btn-import-bibtex" class="btn btn-ghost">导入 BibTeX</button>
    <button id="btn-import-doi" class="btn btn-ghost">导入 DOI</button>
    <button id="btn-library" class="btn btn-ghost">论文库</button>
  </div>
</header>

<div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="notice hidden"></div>
<div class="layout">
  <!-- Left: searches + files -->
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <button id="btn-new-search" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">＋ 新检索</button>
    <button id="btn-new-trace" class="btn btn-block">◎ 从一篇论文扩展</button>
    <h3>检索历史</h3>
    <div id="search-list" class="search-list"></div>
    <h3>文件（报告 / 表格）</h3>
    <div id="file-list" class="file-list"></div>
  </aside>

  <!-- Center: results -->
  <main class="main">
    <div id="welcome" class="welcome">
      <div class="eyebrow">YOUR RESEARCH, CONNECTED</div><h2>从一个好问题，走向有据可循的研究。</h2>
      <p>系统会先澄清问题、生成检索标准，然后跨 Semantic Scholar / OpenAlex / Crossref
         检索，逐篇打分，并顺着引用关系网扩展，最后给出带引用的论文集。</p>
      <div class="workflow"><span>01 澄清问题</span><span>02 确认标准</span><span>03 深度搜索</span><span>04 综合与追问</span></div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="document.getElementById('btn-new-search').click()">开始一次新检索</button>
    </div>

    <div id="search-detail" class="hidden">
      <div class="detail-head">
        <h2 id="detail-question"></h2>
        <div id="detail-meta" class="detail-meta"></div>
